@startuml system-context
title System Context Diagram — UNT Informatics Prep Platform
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<system>> #1F6FEB
  FontColor<<system>> white
  BorderColor<<system>> #1F6FEB
  BackgroundColor<<external>> #EEEEEE
  BorderColor<<external>> #888888
}
left to right direction

actor "Guest\n(UNT candidate)" as Guest
actor "Student\n(free / premium)" as Student
actor "Administrator\n(content owner)" as Admin

rectangle "UNT Informatics Prep Platform\n\n[Next.js web application + PostgreSQL]\nMock tests in UNT format, scoring,\nexplanations, topic analytics, subscriptions" <<system>> as Sys

rectangle "Payment provider\n(local acquiring / aggregator)" <<external>> as Pay
rectangle "Email service\n(SMTP / transactional email)" <<external>> as Mail
rectangle "Hosting & managed DB\n(Vercel, Neon/Supabase)" <<external>> as Host
rectangle "NTC UNT specification\n(public document)" <<external>> as NTC

Guest --> Sys : browses catalogue,\ntries demo test, registers
Student --> Sys : takes timed tests,\nviews results, subscribes
Admin --> Sys : imports & publishes test versions,\nviews analytics
Sys --> Pay : creates checkout session
Pay --> Sys : payment webhook (signed)
Sys --> Mail : verification & reset emails
Sys ..> Host : deployed on / stores data in
NTC ..> Admin : item blueprint & topics\n(used offline when writing items)
@enduml
